          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住蓄力、左右滑動移動，放開起跳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructions.defense" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Bugs crawl down five lanes toward your lunchbox\n• Tap a card, then a lawn square to place it — it costs coins\n• Piggy banks save coins, slingshots fire marbles, schoolbags block, firecrackers blast a whole block\n• Each lane's slipper saves you once; the next bug through ends the run\n• Bugs get more numerous and tougher — squash as many as you can"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 蟲蟲沿著五條路往下爬，目標是你的便當\n• 點下方卡片、再點草地格子放下，要花零用錢\n• 撲滿會存錢、彈弓射彈珠、書包擋路、鞭炮炸開一整片\n• 每條路底的藍白拖能救一次，再有蟲爬到底就結束\n• 蟲會越來越多、越來越硬，打倒越多分數越高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructions.fishing" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Tap anywhere in the water to cast the hook there\n• Tap again to reel it back\n• Only fish touched during the reel-up get caught\n• Deeper fish pay more; junk costs points\n• Every 100 points adds 10 seconds; watch for fish frenzies"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 點水裡任一位置，魚鉤就放到那裡\n• 再點一下開始收線\n• 只有收線途中碰到的魚會被釣上來\n• 越深的魚越值錢；小心垃圾會扣分\n• 每滿 100 分延長 10 秒；偶爾魚群會狂歡湧現"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructions.shaft" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Touch anywhere, then slide left or right — the spot you touch is the centre\n• Landing heals you; spikes hurt\n• Getting pushed into the ceiling spikes or falling off ends the run\n• Grass = safe, spikes = ouch, spring = bounce\n• Sand = conveyor, snow = crumbles"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 按住畫面任一處，以觸點為中心左右滑動移動\n• 踩上平台會回血，尖刺會扣血\n• 被推到頂端尖刺或掉出畫面就結束\n• 草地＝安全、尖刺＝受傷、彈簧＝彈跳\n• 沙地＝輸送帶、雪地＝踩了會消失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructions.snowball" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Tap anywhere and the snowball lands there\n• Hold the left side and slide to move around\n• Use both hands: throw with one while the other walks\n• Clear every enemy to advance; later ones move and aim better\n• Getting hit costs a heart — lose them all and it is over"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 點一下畫面任一處，雪球就落在那裡\n• 按住左半邊左右滑動可以移動走位\n• 雙手並用：左手移動的同時右手照樣能丟\n• 打倒所有敵人進下一關；後面的敵人會移動、也更準\n• 被打中扣一顆心，扣完就結束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructions.swarm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Touch anywhere and slide the way you want to go\n• Your weapons attack on their own — just keep moving\n• Grab the candy bugs drop; each level up picks one of three upgrades\n• A bug touching you costs a heart — lose them all and it is over\n• The longer you last, the more bugs come — squash as many as you can"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 按住畫面任一處，往想去的方向滑動走位\n• 武器會自動攻擊，你只要專心閃躲\n• 撿起蟲蟲掉的糖果累積經驗，升級時三選一強化\n• 被蟲碰到扣一顆心，扣完就結束\n• 撐越久蟲越多，打倒越多分數越高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructions.tower" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Hold to charge; slide left or right from where you touched to steer\n• Release to jump — the longer the hold, the higher the jump\n• The screen scrolls down; falling off the bottom ends the run\n• Snow platforms crumble, purple ones move"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 按住畫面蓄力，以觸點為中心左右滑動移動\n• 放開手指起跳，按越久跳越高\n• 畫面會慢慢往下捲，掉出底部就結束\n• 雪地平台踩了會消失、紫色星球會左右移動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
